 a happy ending are planned upon release besides the netorare ending for those who wish to see our protagonist either live happily ever after or take revenge on those who wronged him.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All the in-game scenes are shown only in pixel art, with no accompanying CG besides the character's portraits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Due to engine limitations and the sheer size of the game, it will have to be split into two different parts to complete development.</p></li></ul>",
